This assumes that all points are equally useful.  If you wish for
Magicbane, you should wish for +2, since there is a significant loss in
magical effects from +2 to +3.  Similarly, if you have two things you
need to charge (the wand and one magic marker), you probably want to
wish for 2 blessed scrolls of charging, rather than wishing for 3 and
possibly getting just 1.

